[ChapterName "1. Pawns Move Forward but Capture Diagonally"]
[FEN "4k3/pppppp1p/8/6p1/5P2/8/PPPPP1PP/4K3 w - - 0 2"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ [#] MCQ: Which move allows the white f-pawn to capture the black pawn?

A) f5
B) fxg5
C) fxe5
D) g4 }

2. fxg5 { Correct Answer: B) fxg5. Pawns move straight forward but capture one square diagonally. } *


