[StudyName "En Passant Day 1 MCQ Classwork"]
[ChapterName "5. En Passant Must Be Played Immediately"]
[FEN "8/2k5/8/1pP5/3K4/8/8/8 w - b6 0 2"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ [#] MCQ: Black has just played b7-b5. What must White play now to use the en passant right?

A) Kd3
B) cxb6+
C) c6
D) Ke5 }

2. cxb6+ { Correct Answer: B) cxb6+. White must capture immediately; the move also gives check to the black king. } *


