[StudyName "En Passant Day 1 MCQ Classwork"]
[ChapterName "7. The Capturing Pawn Lands on the Passed-Over Square"]
[FEN "8/ppp1k3/8/8/5pP1/8/PPP5/5K2 b - g3 0 1"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ [#] MCQ: Black captures the white g-pawn en passant. On which square will the black pawn finish?

A) f3
B) g3
C) g4
D) h3 }

1... fxg3 { Correct Answer: B) g3. The black pawn moves from f4 to g3, the square that the white pawn passed over. } *


