[ChapterName "8. En Passant Removes a Pawn From a Different Square"]
[FEN "rnbqkbnr/ppp1pppp/8/2Pp4/8/8/PP1PPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq d6 0 2"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ [#] MCQ: After White plays cxd6 en passant, which black pawn is removed from the board?

A) The pawn on c5
B) The pawn on d5
C) The pawn on d7
D) The pawn on e7 }

2. cxd6 { Correct Answer: B. The black pawn on d5 is removed even though the white pawn finishes on d6. } *


