[ChapterName "9. White Captures En Passant Onto the Sixth Rank"]
[FEN "rnbqkbnr/ppp1pppp/8/2Pp4/8/8/PP1PPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq d6 0 2"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ [#] MCQ: Black has just moved d7-d5. Which move correctly performs en passant?

A) c6
B) cxd6
C) cxb6
D) d4 }

2. cxd6 { Correct Answer: B) cxd6. A white pawn capturing en passant finishes on the sixth rank. } *


