[ChapterName "10. A Rook Pawn Can Also Capture En Passant"]
[FEN "rnbqkbnr/pp1ppp1p/8/1Pp3pP/8/8/P1PPPPP1/RNBQKBNR w KQkq g6 0 2"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ [#] MCQ: Black has just played g7-g5. Which move allows the white h-pawn to capture en passant?

A) h6
B) hxg6
C) hxg5
D) g4 }

2. hxg6 { Correct Answer: B) hxg6. A rook pawn can capture en passant when an adjacent pawn makes a legal two-square move. } *
